199
00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:12.450
Diislit neelava auto kilomeeter
maksaks umbes 50 eurosenti.

200
00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:18.380
Eestlaste seas populaarne
bensiinimootoriga Honda tahaks teie

201
00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:24.059
